  "comment": "Product Experience V2 trip-type contracts (design 8.1; audit docs/engine-audits/2026-09-14-trip-type-contract-matrix.md). Trip types own closed need IDs, never item lists. needs[].candidates is the one central need-to-candidate map. suggestedActivities are unselected and non-causal: they may order setup suggestions but never enter a trip's activities. excludedNeeds/excludedActivities are the machine-checkable part of nonImplications. Arrays are in stable order; scripts/validate_shared.py enforces the vocabularies against Swift.",
